        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Updated the Firefox support for CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">shape()</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested in the following browsers using the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/basic-shape/shape#examples\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">shape()</code></a> page:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 148.0b14</li>\n<li>Firefox Developer Edition 148.0b14</li>\n<li>Firefox Nightly 149.0a1 (2026-02-10)</li>\n<li>Firefox Beta for Android 148.0b14  (Build #2016143279)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43106\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43106/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
